1. Removed the incorrect `TRPCProvider` import
2. Added the correct imports for trpc, QueryClient, and required utilities
3. Set up the TRPC client with basic configuration
4. Wrapped the component with both the TRPC Provider and QueryClientProvider
5. Maintained the existing component structure while adding the necessary provider setup

This should resolve the error by properly setting up the TRPC provider with the correct imports and configuration. The component should now have access to the TRPC client and be able to make API calls as needed.

